# US-TC-01: Buy a call package to connect with an expert

**Project:** TrueCareer (academic group project) · **My role:** Business Analyst
**Where it fits:** Customer Journey (slide 12 of the presentation), right after the student picks an expert and before the call starts.
**Presentation:** [TrueCareer presentation (PDF)](../Presentation/TrueCareer_presentation.pdf)
**Prototype:** https://fjsshr.axshare.com/?id=1sxs4v

## Context

After the assessment, students see a list of recommended experts who are online right now. Browsing is free, but calling an expert needs a call package. This story covers that step: the student picks a package, pays, and gets the "Connect now" button.

I picked this story because payment is where most of the edge cases are. Money is involved, the expert can go offline at any moment, and the student can change their mind halfway.

## User story

**As a** student who has finished the assessment,
**I want to** buy a call package for the expert I picked,
**so that** I can start a 1-on-1 video call with them right away.

## Before this story starts

- The student is logged in and has finished the assessment.
- The student clicked "Connect now" on an expert who is online.
- The student has no calls left in their account. (If they do, this story is skipped. See BR3.)

