## Packages

| Package | Price | Saving |
|---|---|---|
| 1 call | 189,000 đ | — |
| 2 calls | 339,000 đ | ~10% |
| 3 calls | 399,000 đ | ~30% |

One call lasts **up to 60 minutes**.

Payment methods: MoMo, ZaloPay, Visa/Mastercard, domestic ATM card / Internet Banking.

## Business rules

| ID | Rule |
|---|---|
| BR1 | Only students who have finished the assessment can open the package screen. |
| BR2 | Calls bought are added to the student's account as call credits. |
| BR3 | If the student already has call credits, "Connect now" skips payment and goes straight to connecting. |
| BR4 | Each call uses 1 credit and lasts up to 60 minutes. |
| BR5 | The amount on the payment screen must always match the package selected. |
| BR6 | Prices are set by Admin. The client only shows them and can't change them. |
| BR7 | Credits are only added after the payment gateway confirms success. Not before. |
| BR8 | If the payment isn't completed within 15 minutes,\* the order expires. |
| BR9 | Clicking "Confirm payment" several times must never create more than one transaction. |
| BR10 | If the expert goes offline after payment, the credits stay in the account. The student can call another expert. |

\* My assumption. Needs confirmation from the business side.

## Order status

```
Pending Payment ──► Processing ──► Successful  (credits added)
      │                  └──────► Failed
      ├──► Expired     (15 min, no payment)
      └──► Cancelled   (student leaves or picks another package)
```

## Who can do what

| Role | Can | Can't |
|---|---|---|
| Student | Buy packages, see own credits and payment history | See other students' data |
| Expert | See their own completed calls | See payment details |
| Admin | See all orders, set packages and prices, handle complaints | — |

## Acceptance criteria

**AC1 – Payment goes through**
Given the student picked a package and a payment method
When they click "Confirm payment" and the gateway confirms
Then the order becomes *Successful*, the credits are added, and they see "Payment successful" with the expert's photo, online status and a "Connect now" button.

**AC2 – Amount matches the package**
Given the student picked the 2-call package
When they reach the payment screen
Then the total shows 339,000 đ.

**AC3 – No payment method chosen**
Given the student is on the payment screen
When no payment method is selected
Then "Confirm payment" stays disabled.

**AC4 – Changing the package**
Given the student is on the payment screen
When they click "Choose another package"
Then they go back to the package screen, the same expert is still selected, and no order is created.

**AC5 – Payment fails**
Given the order is *Processing*
When the gateway returns an error
Then the order becomes *Failed*, no credits are added, the student sees why and can retry or switch method without picking the package again.

**AC6 – Student already has credits**
Given the student has at least 1 call credit
When they click "Connect now" on an online expert
Then they skip the package screen and go straight to "In calling".

**AC7 – Expert goes offline after payment**
Given the payment succeeded
When the expert goes offline before the call connects
Then the student is told, keeps their credits, and can pick another expert.

**AC8 – Double click**
Given the order is *Processing*
When the student clicks "Confirm payment" again
Then no new transaction is created.

## Edge cases

- **Connection drops while paying:** the order stays *Processing*. The system checks the real result with the payment gateway, so the student is never charged twice or charged without getting credits.
- **Call drops before 60 minutes:** see open question 3.

## Not in this story

- Refunds (follow the Refund Policy, separate story).
- The call itself, rating the expert, and "Continue connecting" after a call. These are the next stories in the journey.

## Gaps I found in the prototype

1. **The payment screen shows 189,000 đ even when the 2-call package is selected** on the screen before. BR5 and AC2 cover this.
2. **There's no "payment failed" screen.** AC5 describes what it should do.
3. **"Retake test" is planned in the presentation but has no screen yet.**

## Open questions for the business team

1. Can call credits be used with any expert, or only the one the student was looking at when buying?
2. Do credits expire?
3. If a call drops after 5 minutes, does it still use a full credit?
4. Is 15 minutes the right payment timeout, or does the gateway already have its own?
